# Enforce LF line endings for all text files on every platform so formatting
# tools (Prettier endOfLine:lf, rustfmt) and CI behave identically on Windows
# and Linux. Without this, Windows runners check out CRLF (core.autocrlf) and
# `prettier --check` fails on every file while Ubuntu passes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize or alter line endings.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.bmp   binary
*.ico   binary
*.icns  binary
*.webp  binary
*.tiff  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.dll   binary
*.so    binary
*.dylib binary
*.pdf   binary
